      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "3",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekyo kindeetera nze Paulo, omusibe olwa Kurisito Yesu ku lwaimwe abamaghanga agandi, okubasabira eri Katonda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndhuuba nti mwawulira nga Katonda olw'ekisa kye yangemya omulimo guno ku lwaimwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Katonda yandholeka naamanha ekyama kye nga bwe nabaghandiikira mu bumpimpi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwe munaabisoma munaaghanga okubona nga nze bwe ntegeera ekyama eky'entegeka ya Kurisito.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "COL.1.26+COL.1.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kol 1:26-27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu byanda eby'eira ghazira muntu yeenayeena eyamanhisibwaku ku kino mu nsambo oti n'eno Mwoyo y'akyolekamu Abatume be n'abalanzi be abatukuvu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekyama ni kino: olw'Amawulire Amalungi, abamaghanga agandi boona baagabana ku birungi ebyo Katonda by'agha Abayudaaya. Baafuuka omuntu mulala mu Kurisito Yesu, era baagabana ku ebyo Katonda bye yabasuubiza mu Kurisito oyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.3.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Katonda olw'ekisa kye, yampa ekirabo eky'okubunisa Amawulire Amalungi, ng'amaani ge gakola mu nze. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waire nga ninze asembayo mu batuukirivu boonaboona, Katonda yampa omukisa okukobera abamaghanga agandi Amawulire Amalungi, ag'obukombe obuli mu Kurisito obutaloodheka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era n'okumanhisa abantu boonaboona ebifa ku ntegeka, Katonda eyatonda byonabyona ye yali agisiiza okumala ebyanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mperaano ng'abita mu Kikunsu ky'Abaikiriza mu Kurisito, Katonda ayenda amanhise abafuzi n'ab'obukumu abali mu igulu amagezi ge agatakoma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Katonda yakola kino ng'ajiira ku kigendererwa eky'ebyanda n'ebyanda era kye yatuukiriza mu Kurisito Yesu Musengwa waife. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nga tubita mu Kurisito oyo, olw'okumwikiriza, tuguma twaseeta ye Katonda nga titutya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyenva mbeeghemba, mulobe kuwaamu maani olw'okubona nga ndaagadaaga ku lwaimwe, kuba ekyo kibagheesa ekitiisa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.3.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyenva ni nkuba amakiryaivu mu maiso ga Lata, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ebika byonabyona eby'omu igulu n'eby'oku nsi mwe bisimuka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naamusaba olw'ekitiisa ekyodo, abagumye ng'abagha amaani, mule munda, ng'abita mu Mwoyo we, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kurisito abe mu myoyo gyaimwe olw'okwikiriza kwaimwe. Musimbire irala emizi mu kugonza era mukalangukiremu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olwo imwe, aghalala n'abatuukirivu boonaboona, musobole okumanha okugonza kwa Kurisito bwe kuli okunene, ate nga kuleeyi, mu bugungumavu, ni mu kwika ghansi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbasabira mumanhe okugonza okwo okulemye abamanhi boonaboona okumanha, olwo mwidhulire irala Katonda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.3.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Katonda oyo asobola okukola ebisinga n'ebyo bye tusaba, oba ebyo bye tutegeera, olw'amaani ge agakolera mu ife, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "agheebwe ekitiisa mu Kikunsu ky'Abaikiriza mu Kurisito, ni mu Kurisito Yesu, ni mu nse dhoonadhoona, ebyanda n'ebyanda. Amiina.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.3.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
